  "coverage_limits": [
    "Ambient Cargo and git configuration is not read: $CARGO_HOME/config.toml, CARGO_NET_GIT_FETCH_WITH_CLI, git insteadOf rewrites",
    "Only workspace .cargo/config.toml files are read. Only the root one suppresses the finding, with the boolean true; a subdirectory one that sets anything else keeps it. A .cargo/config.toml above the root and the legacy extensionless .cargo/config are not read; Cargo prefers .cargo/config over .cargo/config.toml in the same directory, and CARGO_NET_GIT_FETCH_WITH_CLI=false overrides every file, so either can make a suppressed project use the built-in fetcher again",
    "Cargo before 1.39.0 does not read .cargo/config.toml, so a root git-fetch-with-cli = true suppresses the finding only for a pinned Rust 1.39.0 or later",
    "Rustup overrides and RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN are not observed (rust.toolchain_override: unobserved)",
    "Independently patched Cargo builds match by release number",
    "SSH registry indexes are not covered",
    "An unpinned channel, rust-version minimum or missing Cargo.lock is inconclusive, never clean"
  ],
  "versioning": "bifrost.security 3.1.0 -> 3.2.0 restores one opt-in policy. The rules stream moves to 0.16.0 because the minimum engine rises to Bifrost 0.15.3."
